Description: PHP client library for the NetBox REST API
 PHP client for NetBox IPAM / DCIM (mkevenaar/netbox). Provides a Guzzle-based
 HTTP client and resource classes covering IPAM, DCIM, circuits, virtualization,
 tenancy, extras and related NetBox API endpoints.
